        {
            "pid": "kaelen_beat_1",
            "name": "kaelen_intro",
            "setting_description": "The corridor behind the marketplace is quiet. Dust drifts through the late afternoon light. Footsteps approach from behind, light and practiced, almost nonexistent.",
            "prompt": "KAELEN: \"Hey! You! You’re that newcomer, right? The one those two were staring at. Look... I shouldn't be talking to you. But I saw you with them. And I need to say something.\"",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Ah! You just came out of nowhere! Uh, what is it?",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_2",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Truth",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.02
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "text": "Why me?",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_2",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Observation",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.01
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "text": "You’re hiding something?",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_2",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "NarrativePresence",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.01
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "text": "...Are you alright?",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_2",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Empathy",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pid": "kaelen_beat_2",
            "name": "kaelen_probe",
            "prompt": "KAELEN: \"...That thing. On your belt. Where did you get something like that?\"",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "It was given to me by someone in the desert.",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_3",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Truth",
                            "value": 0.04
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.02
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "text": "I’m following its resonance. It led me here.",
                    "target": "kaelen_beat_3",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Observation",
                            "value": 0.04
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.01
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pid": "kaelen_beat_3",
            "name": "kaelen_confession",
            "shared_beat": "Kaelen’s posture collapses. He looks down at his hands, his voice thinning as he offers up a confession he cannot carry alone. KAELEN: \"I was there. When it happened. The collapse. The girl. She was chasing a scent. I was chasing a wallet. I could've stopped her. I should've. But I was focused on the lift. I froze like a coward.\"",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "You should tell them.",
                    "target": "kaelen_end",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Truth",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "system_trigger": "transition:Remembrance_Search",
                    "data_hook": "set_flag:kaelen_confessed=true"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What exactly happened?",
                    "target": "kaelen_end",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Observation",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.02
                        }
                    ],
                    "system_trigger": "transition:Remembrance_Search",
                    "data_hook": "set_flag:kaelen_confessed=true"
                },
                {
                    "text": "You don’t owe me this confession.",
                    "target": "kaelen_end",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "NarrativePresence",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.01
                        }
                    ],
                    "system_trigger": "transition:Remembrance_Search",
                    "data_hook": "set_flag:kaelen_confessed=true"
                },
                {
                    "text": "...You froze. People freeze. That doesn’t make you a monster.",
                    "target": "kaelen_end",
                    "tone_effects": [
                        {
                            "key": "Empathy",
                            "value": 0.03
                        }
                    ],
                    "npc_resonance": [
                        {
                            "key": "Kaelen",
                            "value": 0.04
                        }
                    ],
                    "system_trigger": "transition:Remembrance_Search",
                    "data_hook": "set_flag:kaelen_confessed=true"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "pid": "kaelen_end",
            "name": "kaelen_end",
            "text": "The corridor seems to breathe with the weight of the memory. The path ahead opens.",
